    <string name="hor_help">Balloons with a Horus Binary payload (e.g. RS41ng) transmit 4FSK at 100 Bd on 70 cm – most often 434.200 MHz; current flights and frequencies: amateur.sondehub.org. Receive in USB with the phone next to the speaker. The plot should show four lines about 270 Hz apart; the decoder finds them by itself (100–4000 Hz).</string>
